body:
@rafaelfranca, i created a failing test for #7538, but i think it belongs here. please see comment [there](https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/7538#issuecomment-23434769). Calling `to_sql` on arel object before sending to `select_values` is OK. only when `select_values` has to convert the arel object to a sql string is there an error.

tests pass for sqlite3, fail for mysql2, did not test other adapters.

i realize the test is probably in the wrong file/place, but i was merely trying to show reproducible failures. thank you.
